# Settings Group component (check in each look). Material window 1040x700 at 440,205.
ipc panels settings appearance
wait 2
shot g1
note G1 captions, tiles (24/4 corners, 2 px gaps) and footer text match the QML shot.
rec hover 3 ptr move 900 500 sleep 500 glide 900 560 900 glide 900 620 900
wait 1
shot g2
note G2 each tile lights under the pointer in about 150 ms and un-lights after; it stays lit while over the row's switch. Row y values are guesses: read three rows from the g1 shot.
ipc panels settings wallpaper
wait 2
shot wallpaper-a
note G3 note the groups shown on the Wallpaper page before flipping Dynamic.
# MANUAL: G3 flip the "Dynamic" choice so a conditional group appears/disappears; a group with no rows leaves no caption and no gap, as QML
ipc panels close
